From 848723d94153bb6cb1384914f55795564277f1fc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Aditi Bombe <196845785+adi05b@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 00:49:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add Niamey (Niger) and Ekaterinburg (Russia) to
 state_or_province

Two new rows, appended so minmod_id stays ascending in file order
(Q2001-Q8000 is the state range in data/entities/README.md).

Q7085 Niamey, Niger: the eighth first-level division of Niger, missing
next to the other seven regions. id 5685, state_code 8 and coordinates
are dr5hn's; type is blank like the other Niger rows.

Q7086 Ekaterinburg, Russia, type city: kept as the source writes it
rather than mapped to Sverdlovsk Oblast. It has no dr5hn state id and
no ISO 3166-2 code, so id, state_code and coordinates are blank.

The file keeps its existing convention of no newline at end of file.
---
 data/entities/state_or_province.csv | 4 +++-
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/data/entities/state_or_province.csv b/data/entities/state_or_province.csv
index eeedcfc..67caae6 100644
--- a/data/entities/state_or_province.csv
+++ b/data/entities/state_or_province.csv
@@ -5082,4 +5082,6 @@ Q7080,1953,Mashonaland West Province,247,ZW,Zimbabwe,MW,,-17.4851029,29.7889248
 Q7081,1960,Masvingo Province,247,ZW,Zimbabwe,MV,,-20.6241509,31.2626366
 Q7082,1954,Matabeleland North Province,247,ZW,Zimbabwe,MN,,-18.5331566,27.5495846
 Q7083,1952,Matabeleland South Province,247,ZW,Zimbabwe,MS,,-21.052337,29.0459927
-Q7084,1957,Midlands Province,247,ZW,Zimbabwe,MI,,-19.0552009,29.6035495
\ No newline at end of file
+Q7084,1957,Midlands Province,247,ZW,Zimbabwe,MI,,-19.0552009,29.6035495
+Q7085,5685,Niamey,160,NE,Niger,8,,13.51361111,2.10888889
+Q7086,,Ekaterinburg,182,RU,Russia,,city,,
\ No newline at end of file
